    "updated_at": "2016-07-07T22:21:33Z",
    "body": "Note that there is code out there that does browser sniffing and would break in browsers it does not sniff as \"WebKit\" that don't have `document.load`.  Edge gets away with things because it gets sniffed as \"WebKit\".  See https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=14037#c10 and relatedly https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=14037#c14 and I'm so tired of having to repeat this stuff every so often....\n",
