    "body": "And note that the current spec was written precisely in a way that would allow all UAs to implement it and be compatible with known existing content...  That's what https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=14037 was all about.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
