    "body": "Yes, I think that adding comments is definitely the correct way to handle this sort of thing.\n\nSo Mozilla would prefer we add this back in [Gecko compatibility mode](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-navigator-compatibility-mode)? I assume that'd be easier than trying to do telemetry to see if things have changed since 2011.\n",
